---
type Props = {
	lang: 'es' | 'en';
};

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEs = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="pv-screen">
	<div class="pv-shell">
		<header class="pv-header">
			<span class="pv-badge">{isEs ? 'Manejo de Memoria' : 'Memory Management'}</span>
			<h1 class="pv-title">
				{isEs ? 'Paso por Valor vs Paso por Referencia' : 'Pass by Value vs Pass by Reference'}
			</h1>
			<p class="pv-sub">
				{isEs 
					? 'Comparativa del comportamiento de parámetros en C, JavaScript, Python y Java.' 
					: 'Comparing parameter passing behavior across C, JavaScript, Python, and Java.'}
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="pv-deck-card">
			<div class="pv-nav-bar">
				<div class="pv-slide-indicator">
					<span class="pv-step-dot"></span>
					<span id="pv-slide-label">SLIDE 1 / 6</span>
				</div>
				<div class="pv-pills">
					<button class="pv-pill-btn active" data-target-slide="1">1. {isEs ? 'Concepto' : 'Concept'}</button>
					<button class="pv-pill-btn" data-target-slide="2">2. C</button>
					<button class="pv-pill-btn" data-target-slide="3">3. Java</button>
					<button class="pv-pill-btn" data-target-slide="4">4. JavaScript</button>
					<button class="pv-pill-btn" data-target-slide="5">5. Python</button>
					<button class="pv-pill-btn" data-target-slide="6">6. {isEs ? 'Simulador Stack' : 'Stack Sim'}</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="pv-viewport">
				<!-- SLIDE 1: CONCEPT -->
				<div class="pv-slide active" data-slide="1">
					<div class="pv-slide-grid">
						<div class="pv-col">
							<h2 class="pv-slide-title">1. {isEs ? '¿Cómo se pasan los datos a una función?' : 'How are arguments passed to functions?'}</h2>
							<p class="pv-text">
								{isEs 
									? 'Al invocar una función, los argumentos pueden pasarse por copia del valor o compartiendo la referencia directa a la celda de memoria original.'
									: 'When invoking a function, arguments are either copied by value or share a direct memory reference.'}
							</p>
							<div class="pv-concept-box">
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">{isEs ? 'Paso por Valor:' : 'Pass by Value:'}</strong>
									<span>{isEs ? 'La función recibe una copia independiente. Modificar el parámetro NO altera la variable original.' : 'Function receives an independent copy. Modifying the parameter DOES NOT alter original.'}</span>
								</div>
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">{isEs ? 'Paso por Referencia:' : 'Pass by Reference:'}</strong>
									<span>{isEs ? 'La función recibe un alias a la variable del llamador. Cualquier cambio altera directamente el valor original.' : 'Function receives an alias to caller variable. Any change mutates the caller value.'}</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pv-col">
							<div class="pv-stack-viz">
								<div class="pv-viz-head">{isEs ? 'ESQUEMA DE MEMORIA EN PILA (STACK)' : 'STACK MEMORY LAYOUT'}</div>
								<div class="pv-frame">
									<span class="pv-frame-label">Stack Frame: main()</span>
									<div class="pv-var-row"><span>x = 10</span><span class="pv-tag-val">0x7FF01</span></div>
								</div>
								<div class="pv-arrow-down">⬇️ {isEs ? 'Copia de valor' : 'Value Copy'}</div>
								<div class="pv-frame sub">
									<span class="pv-frame-label">Stack Frame: update(val)</span>
									<div class="pv-var-row"><span>val = 10</span><span class="pv-tag-val">{isEs ? 'Copia independiente' : 'Isolated Copy'}</span></div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 2: C -->
				<div class="pv-slide" data-slide="2">
					<div class="pv-slide-grid">
						<div class="pv-col">
							<h2 class="pv-slide-title">2. C: {isEs ? 'Paso por Valor Estricto y Punteros' : 'Strict Pass-by-Value & Pointers'}</h2>
							<p class="pv-text">
								{isEs 
									? 'En C TODO es paso por valor. Para modificar una variable externa, pasamos la dirección de memoria (puntero `&var`) por valor.'
									: 'In C EVERYTHING is pass-by-value. To modify an external variable, we pass the memory address (`&var`) by value.'}
							</p>
							<ul class="pv-list">
								<li><strong>swap(int a, int b):</strong> {isEs ? 'Intercambia copias locales, sin efecto en main.' : 'Swaps local copies, no effect in main.'}</li>
								<li><strong>swap(int *a, int *b):</strong> {isEs ? 'Desreferencia direcciones para modificar la memoria del llamador.' : 'Dereferences addresses to modify caller memory.'}</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="pv-col">
							<div class="pv-code-card">
								<div class="pv-code-title">pointers.c</div>
								<pre class="pv-code-block"><code><span class="token-keyword">void</span> swap(<span class="token-type">int</span> *a, <span class="token-type">int</span> *b) &#123;
    <span class="token-type">int</span> temp = *a;
    *a = *b;  <span class="token-comment">// Modifica memoria original</span>
    *b = temp;
&#125;

<span class="token-type">int</span> main() &#123;
    <span class="token-type">int</span> x = <span class="token-number">5</span>, y = <span class="token-number">10</span>;
    swap(&amp;x, &amp;y); <span class="token-comment">// x=10, y=5</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 3: JAVA -->
				<div class="pv-slide" data-slide="3">
					<div class="pv-slide-grid">
						<div class="pv-col">
							<h2 class="pv-slide-title">3. Java: {isEs ? 'Siempre por Valor (Primitivos vs Referencias)' : 'Always Pass-by-Value (Primitives vs References)'}</h2>
							<p class="pv-text">
								{isEs 
									? 'Java es SIEMPRE paso por valor. En primitivos copia el valor. En objetos copia el handle de referencia.'
									: 'Java is ALWAYS pass-by-value. For primitives it copies the value. For objects it copies the reference handle.'}
							</p>
							<div class="pv-concept-box">
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">Mutar atributos:</strong> {isEs ? 'Afecta al objeto en el Heap.' : 'Affects the Heap object.'}
								</div>
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">Reasignar referencia:</strong> {isEs ? 'Solo cambia la copia local del puntero, no el objeto original.' : 'Only updates local handle copy, not original caller handle.'}
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pv-col">
							<div class="pv-code-card">
								<div class="pv-code-title">PassTest.java</div>
								<pre class="pv-code-block"><code><span class="token-keyword">public static void</span> modify(<span class="token-type">Dog</span> d) &#123;
    d.setName(<span class="token-string">"Rex"</span>); <span class="token-comment">// Mutación en Heap</span>
    d = <span class="token-keyword">new</span> <span class="token-type">Dog</span>(<span class="token-string">"Fido"</span>); <span class="token-comment">// No afecta al caller</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 4: JAVASCRIPT -->
				<div class="pv-slide" data-slide="4">
					<div class="pv-slide-grid">
						<div class="pv-col">
							<h2 class="pv-slide-title">4. JavaScript: {isEs ? 'Paso por Valor de Referencias' : 'Call-by-Sharing (Reference Copy)'}</h2>
							<p class="pv-text">
								{isEs 
									? 'Los primitivos en JS son inmutables y se pasan por valor. Los objetos y arreglos se pasan por valor de referencia.'
									: 'Primitives in JS are immutable and passed by value. Objects and arrays are passed by reference copy.'}
							</p>
							<ul class="pv-list">
								<li><strong>obj.prop = val:</strong> {isEs ? 'Muta el objeto real.' : 'Mutates actual object.'}</li>
								<li><strong>obj = &#123;&#125;:</strong> {isEs ? 'Reasigna solo la variable local de la función.' : 'Rebinds function-local variable only.'}</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="pv-col">
							<div class="pv-code-card">
								<div class="pv-code-title">app.js</div>
								<pre class="pv-code-block"><code><span class="token-keyword">function</span> update(user) &#123;
    user.age = <span class="token-number">30</span>;     <span class="token-comment">// Objeto original actualizado</span>
    user = &#123; age: <span class="token-number">99</span> &#125;; <span class="token-comment">// Sin efecto fuera</span>
&#125;
<span class="token-keyword">const</span> u = &#123; age: <span class="token-number">20</span> &#125;;
update(u); <span class="token-comment">// u.age es 30</span></code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 5: PYTHON -->
				<div class="pv-slide" data-slide="5">
					<div class="pv-slide-grid">
						<div class="pv-col">
							<h2 class="pv-slide-title">5. Python: {isEs ? 'Paso por Asignación (Pass-by-Object-Reference)' : 'Pass-by-Assignment'}</h2>
							<p class="pv-text">
								{isEs 
									? 'En Python los argumentos se pasan por asignación. La función vincula un nombre local al objeto recibido.'
									: 'In Python arguments are passed by assignment. The function binds a local name to the received object.'}
							</p>
							<div class="pv-concept-box">
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">list.append():</strong> {isEs ? 'Mutación in-place en Heap.' : 'In-place mutation in Heap.'}
								</div>
								<div class="pv-concept-item">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">lst = lst + [x]:</strong> {isEs ? 'Crea un nuevo objeto y re-vincula el nombre local.' : 'Creates a new object and rebinds local name.'}
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="pv-col">
							<div class="pv-code-card">
								<div class="pv-code-title">script.py</div>
								<pre class="pv-code-block"><code><span class="token-keyword">def</span> process(lst):
    lst.append(<span class="token-number">100</span>) <span class="token-comment"># Mutación real</span>
    lst = [<span class="token-number">1</span>, <span class="token-number">2</span>]    <span class="token-comment"># Re-binding local</span>

data = [<span class="token-number">1</span>]
process(data) <span class="token-comment"># data es [1, 100]</span></code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 6: SIMULATOR -->
				<div class="pv-slide" data-slide="6">
					<div class="pv-sim-container">
						<h2 class="pv-slide-title center">{isEs ? '6. Simulador Interactivo de Pila (Stack Frame)' : '6. Live Call Stack Simulator'}</h2>
						<p class="pv-sub center">{isEs ? 'Probá cómo se comporta el pasaje en cada lenguaje:' : 'Test parameter passing behavior across languages:'}</p>

						<div class="pv-sim-selector">
							<button class="pv-lang-btn active" data-lang="c">C (Punteros)</button>
							<button class="pv-lang-btn" data-lang="java">Java (Objetos)</button>
							<button class="pv-lang-btn" data-lang="js">JavaScript</button>
							<button class="pv-lang-btn" data-lang="py">Python</button>
						</div>

						<div class="pv-sim-console">
							<div class="pv-sim-head">
								<span class="pv-console-label" id="pv-sim-title">C: swap(&amp;a, &amp;b) Execution Trace</span>
							</div>
							<div class="pv-sim-body">
								<div class="pv-trace-step" id="pv-sim-step">
									<strong class="pv-accent-text">Paso 1:</strong> main() crea `a=5` (0x10) y `b=10` (0x14). Pasa direcciones `&a` y `&b`.
								</div>
								<div class="pv-stack-display" id="pv-sim-stack">
									[main frame: a=5, b=10] -&gt; [swap frame: *a=&gt;0x10, *b=&gt;0x14]
								</div>
								<div class="pv-res-box" id="pv-sim-result">
									{isEs ? 'Resultado en el caller: a=10, b=5 (Mutación Exitosa)' : 'Caller result: a=10, b=5 (Successful Mutation)'}
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="pv-sim-actions">
								<button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-next-trace">
									▶ {isEs ? 'Siguiente Paso de Ejecución' : 'Next Execution Step'}
								</button>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="pv-footer">
				<button class="btn btn-secondary" id="btn-prev-pv" disabled>
					← {isEs ? 'Anterior' : 'Previous'}
				</button>
				<div class="pv-footer-meta">
					<span>{isEs ? 'Navegación: Flechas Izq / Der' : 'Navigation: Left / Right Arrows'}</span>
				</div>
				<button class="btn btn-primary" id="btn-next-pv">
					{isEs ? 'Siguiente' : 'Next'} →
				</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');

	.pv-screen {
		min-height: 80vh;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-text);
		padding: 1.5rem 1rem 4rem;
	}

	.pv-shell { max-width: var(--container-max); margin: 0 auto; }
	.pv-header { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

	.pv-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-2-300);
		background: var(--color-accent-2-100);
		color: var(--color-accent-2-700);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.pv-title {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.15;
		color: var(--color-text);
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem;
	}

	.pv-sub { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 75%, transparent); font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }
	.pv-sub.center { text-align: center; }

	.pv-deck-card {
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.pv-nav-bar {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 60%, transparent);
	}

	.pv-slide-indicator {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-accent-700);
	}

	.pv-step-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent); }
	.pv-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }

	.pv-pill-btn {
		border: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
		background: var(--color-bg);
		color: var(--color-text);
		border-radius: 999px;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 600;
		cursor: pointer;
		transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
	}

	.pv-pill-btn:hover { background: var(--color-accent-100); border-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-700); }
	.pv-pill-btn.active { background: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); color: #ffffff; }

	.pv-viewport { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; min-height: 420px; }
	.pv-slide { display: none; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease; }
	.pv-slide.active { display: block; opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

	.pv-slide-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; }
	.pv-col { grid-column: span 12; }
	@media (min-width: 900px) { .pv-col { grid-column: span 6; } }

	.pv-slide-title { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
	.pv-slide-title.center { text-align: center; }

	.pv-text { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 85%, transparent); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
	.pv-concept-box { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
	.pv-concept-item { background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; }
	.pv-accent-text { color: var(--color-accent-700); }

	.pv-list { padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }

	.pv-stack-viz { background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1rem; }
	.pv-viz-head { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-accent-2-700); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
	.pv-frame { background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0.75rem; }
	.pv-frame.sub { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-100) 50%, transparent); }
	.pv-frame-label { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-accent-700); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
	.pv-var-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; }
	.pv-tag-val { color: var(--color-accent-2-700); font-weight: 600; }
	.pv-arrow-down { text-align: center; margin: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; color: var(--color-accent-700); }

	.pv-code-card { background: #1e1b18; border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }
	.pv-code-title { background: #2b2722; color: #c0b6a5; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #3a352e; }
	.pv-code-block { margin: 0; padding: 0.9rem; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #f9f4ed; overflow-x: auto; }

	.token-keyword { color: #e59866; font-weight: 600; }
	.token-type { color: #76d7c4; }
	.token-number { color: #f8c471; }
	.token-string { color: #abebc6; }
	.token-comment { color: #85929e; font-style: italic; }

	/* Simulator */
	.pv-sim-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
	.pv-sim-selector { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
	.pv-lang-btn { border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); background: var(--color-bg); color: var(--color-text); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease; }
	.pv-lang-btn:hover { background: var(--color-accent-100); color: var(--color-accent-700); }
	.pv-lang-btn.active { background: var(--color-accent-700); border-color: var(--color-accent-700); color: #ffffff; }

	.pv-sim-console { background: #1e1b18; border: 1px solid var(--color-divider); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
	.pv-sim-head { background: #2b2722; padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem; }
	.pv-console-label { color: #c0b6a5; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; }
	.pv-sim-body { padding: 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.8rem; }
	.pv-trace-step { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #f9f4ed; background: #2a2520; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
	.pv-stack-display { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #76d7c4; background: #141210; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
	.pv-res-box { background: #1b2e22; border-left: 3px solid #2ecc71; color: #abebc6; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
	.pv-sim-actions { padding: 0.8rem 1rem; background: #25211d; display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; border-top: 1px solid #3a352e; }

	.pv-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 60%, transparent); }
	.pv-footer-meta { font-size: 0.78rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 60%, transparent); }
	.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
</style>

<script>
	let currentSlide = 1;
	const totalSlides = 6;
	let currentTraceIndex = 0;

	const traceData = {
		c: {
			title: 'C: swap(&a, &b) - Punteros',
			steps: [
				'Paso 1: main() instancia a=5 (0x10) y b=10 (0x14). Invoca swap(&a, &b).',
				'Paso 2: swap desreferencia *a y *b modificando las direcciones 0x10 y 0x14 directamente.',
				'Paso 3: swap finaliza y destruye su stack frame.'
			],
			stacks: [
				'[main: a=5 (0x10), b=10 (0x14)] -> [swap: *a=>0x10, *b=>0x14]',
				'[main: a=10 (0x10), b=5 (0x14)] (Mutación en proceso)',
				'[main: a=10, b=5]'
			],
			results: [
				'En proceso...',
				'En proceso...',
